================================================================
145. EVIDENCE TIERS
===================

Continue Upgrade-11 E0-E5 evidence model.

Customer-facing claims require evidence.

Examples:

PUBLIC_API:
E3 system tested

STRIPE:
E2 contract tested
or E4 sandbox-tested if actual Stripe test account is used

BILLING:
Do not say LIVE if only FakeBillingProvider was used.

================================================================
146. TEST ACCOUNTING
====================

Report:

core unit
PostgreSQL
tenant security
web
billing
API
SDK
webhooks
onboarding
system E2E

Required SaaS web tests cannot be hidden under optional skip.

================================================================
147. PUBLIC API DOC TEST
========================

Examples shown in developer docs must be runnable/tested where practical.

Prevent stale:

endpoint
field
SDK method

documentation.

================================================================
148. SECURITY TEST MATRIX
=========================

Mandatory:

cross-tenant public API
cross-tenant SDK
cross-tenant webhook
API key scope
revoked key
idempotency abuse
rate-limit abuse
webhook SSRF
billing webhook forgery
GitHub install state forgery
XSS from agent/repository output
CSRF
billing replay
usage duplication

================================================================
149. PERFORMANCE
================

