## 24. Remaining Limitations

Explicitly state:

Stripe sandbox/live tested?
real payments processed?
tax/VAT automation?
multi-currency?
payment provider failover?
PITR end-to-end?
PostgreSQL HA?
multi-region control plane?
BYOK/CMEK?
mobile application?
external compliance certification?

## 25. Final Verdict

Never say:

FULL SAAS READY
BILLING VERIFIED
PAYMENTS PRODUCTION READY
ENTERPRISE COMMERCIAL READY

unless each exact claim has executed evidence.

Do not call Stripe integration verified if only FakeBillingProvider was
tested.

Do not call the API stable until compatibility/versioning rules and
contract tests exist.

Do not call customer onboarding complete if GitHub/billing/job state is
only stored in frontend state.

The objective of Upgrade-12 is a real product surface over the existing
control plane — not a mock dashboard.
